  "behaviors": [
    "Only an explicit bitcoin_attestation_verified status and verified=true can show the confirmed badge; standard block identity, timestamp and selected network must agree.",
    "When an expected file digest is supplied, digest_matches must be true and file_digest must exactly match it. Without a digest, the UI states that file identity was not checked.",
    "Pending calendar attestations, rejected proofs, explicit network mismatch, unsupported operations/attestations and unavailable owned headers retain distinct nonpositive presentation.",
    "Proof, expected-digest and network changes cancel outstanding requests and clear previous results, including late old-network responses.",
    "The UI renders earliest_proven_block_height, earliest_proven_time_utc and operation_count rather than the previous nonexistent aliases."
  ],
